1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,320
A number pyramid stands tall...

2
00:00:02,760 --> 00:00:04,680
but some blocks are missing!

3
00:00:06,300 --> 00:00:08,220
This is Math Pyramid!

4
00:00:08,560 --> 00:00:12,460
Each block equals the two blocks below it, added together!

5
00:00:13,860 --> 00:00:14,280
Four...

6
00:00:14,280 --> 00:00:15,520
plus six...

7
00:00:15,520 --> 00:00:16,800
that's ten!

8
00:00:17,920 --> 00:00:20,560
Type it in, and the block locks in!

9
00:00:21,080 --> 00:00:24,140
Fill in every missing block, all the way to the top!

10
00:00:25,400 --> 00:00:31,060
Every row builds on the row below — one pyramid, built block by block!

11
00:00:32,140 --> 00:00:37,900
Parents — this builds addition fluency and pattern sense, one block at a time!

12
00:00:38,940 --> 00:00:40,400
Ready to build one yourself?

13
00:00:41,320 --> 00:00:46,740
Tap Math Game Zone, climb into Math Pyramid, pick your level, and start stacking!

14
00:00:46,740 --> 00:00:52,360
Abacus Kids — free to download on the App Store and Google Play!
